When editing `subqdocs-backend/src/sequelize/`, open [`docs/kb/subqdocs-backend/INDEX.md`](../../docs/kb/subqdocs-backend/INDEX.md) and [`docs/kb/subqdocs-backend/sequelize.md`](../../docs/kb/subqdocs-backend/sequelize.md). Follow [`docs/kb/backend/conventions.md`](../../docs/kb/backend/conventions.md). Load [`docs/skills/17-database-migration-safety.md`](../../docs/skills/17-database-migration-safety.md) before ALTER TABLE migrations.

